  "prefLabel": "Opt 401.02 Renewal of License",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-04",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 401.02 Renewal of License. On or before June 30 of each year in which a license is due to expire, any licensee wishing to renew a license shall submit the renewal application form supplied by the board along with the fee specified by Opt 303.01 Table 303.1 and proof of completion of continuing education.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Opt 100) #5839, eff 6-17-94, EXPIRED: 6-17-00\n\nNew. #7370, INTERIM, eff 9-30-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-01\n\nNew. #7670, eff 4-4-02, EXPIRED: 4-4-10\n\nNew. #9756, eff 7-20-10; ss by #12383, eff 9-16-17",
